  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>answer_questions - answers the questions in questions.csv from kb_chunks, with sources (server copy of
lab 21).
Needs the same kettle.properties lines as build_knowledge_base; parameters TOP_K 4 and MIN_SCORE
0.75.

1. csvi-questions: CSV file input, ${RAG_DATA_DIR}/questions.csv.
2. emb-question: Text to Vector, the question with nomic-embed-text.
3. vs-kb: Vector Search, kb_chunks, TOP_K matches above MIN_SCORE, one JSON array per question.
4. js-prompt: Modified JavaScript value, numbered passages and the question into prompt.
5. const-instruction: Add constants, the run instruction (answer only from the passages, as JSON).
6. ai-answer: AI Chat on Ollama, ${MODEL_NAME} at ${OLLAMA_URL}, temperature 0, into llm_json.
7. json-answer: JSON input, answer, cited_sources and found.
8. sv-answers, txt-answers: one line per question to ${RAG_OUT_DIR}/answers.csv.

Shipped data: none; it reads the 7 questions in ${RAG_DATA_DIR}/questions.csv.</note>
      <xloc>160</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>614</width>
      <heigth>278</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>10</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
